  "history_of_present_illness": "The patient is a 73\u2011year\u2011old man with a long history of hypertension (since 1991) and obesity. Over the past decade he developed type 2 diabetes with proteinuria, progressing from CKD stage 2 in 2005 to CKD stage 4 by 2011. In September\u2011October 2011 he underwent coronary artery bypass grafting for ischemic heart disease and was simultaneously placed on the kidney transplant waiting list. Since then he has been managed with antihypertensives, antiplatelet therapy, statin, insulin, and nitroglycerin, but key renoprotective agents (ACE\u2011I/ARB, SGLT2\u2011i) are absent. He also has anemia of chronic disease, metabolic syndrome, and persistent social isolation. The most recent encounter recorded in 2013 shows stable but high\u2011complexity chronic disease burden with moderate polypharmacy and several missing laboratory data points.",
